==English==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|enm|en}} {{m|enm|softely}}, {{m|enm|softeliche}}, equivalent to {{suffix|soft|ly|lang=en|nocat=1}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|GenAm}} {{IPA|/ˈsɔftli/|lang=en}}
* {{a|cot-caught|Canada}} {{IPA|/ˈsɑftli/|lang=en}}
* {{a|RP}} {{IPA|/ˈsɒftli/|lang=en}}
* {{audio|en-us-softly.ogg|Audio (US)|lang=en}}

===Adverb===
{{en-adv|er|more}}

# In a [[soft]] manner; [[gently]].
# Not [[loudly]]; nearly [[inaudible]].

